// Single-target force bolt. D&D's Constitution save and the Construct/
// Undead auto-immunity rider are both dropped -- this engine resolves
// ranged spell hits via its own dodge/block combat pipeline, not D&D-style
// saving throws, and there is no creature-kind-conditional immunity
// primitive (same documented gap OtherworldlyWard/dispel_evil_and_good's
// own creature-kind wards already work around). Ships as a plain
// single-target Force damage bolt, reusing the generic projectile visuals
// every other cantrip/level-1 bolt in this wave already uses.
BasicRanged(
    energy_cost: 30.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    projectile: (
        kind: Simple,
        attack: Some((
            damage: 18,
            damage_kind: Force,
        )),
    ),
    projectile_body: Object(BoltFire),
    projectile_speed: 55.0,
    num_projectiles: Value(1),
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
